## Recovered Assets

Root visually inspected all three selected original outputs. Each is a PNG
with actual dimensions 1448x1086 (4:3), regardless of the requested 1536x1152.
They are copied byte-for-byte into `public/marketing/home/`:

- `bookshop-light-v1.png`: warm dusk bookshop, blinds and atmospheric light.
- `lantern-fox-v1.png`: watercolor fox carrying a lantern through misty woods.
- `jiangnan-rain-v2.png`: rainy tiled-eave lane and warm lantern reflections;
  no visible corner emblem in the selected second generation.

The rejected `jiangnan-rain-v1.png` remains evidence only and is not published.
`assets/image-manifest.json` links selected public paths, actual dimensions,
hashes, full generation prompts and key-free successful provider receipts.
These are fixed illustrative assets, not site generation records.

